# Phase 5 QUESTION-RESUME: every way an ask_user_question batch can end,
# then the session resumed. A batch of 1 and a batch of 4 answered by
# ordinal, a batch of 21 and a batch of none refused before any panel opens,
# one step of a failed read, an empty batch and another failed read, and a
# batch of 2 cancelled with Escape, which stops its turn. fx v0.0.16 replays
# an answered batch from its saved document (`writeAnsweredQuestionResult`,
# app_session_runtime.zig:4589-4607@481104fd), every other ending through the
# generic tool path, and each call of a step before the next
# (`writeExecutionHistoryToSink`, :4120-4127); `live` is the screen the resume
# replays.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-question-resume-turns.json
wait 4
type ask one
key Enter
wait 3
type 2
wait 3
type ask four
key Enter
wait 3
type 1212
wait 3
type ask too many
key Enter
wait 3
type ask none
key Enter
wait 3
type ask mixed
key Enter
wait 3
type ask stop
key Enter
wait 3
key Escape
wait 3
snap live
snapfull live
keep
type /quit
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 5
snap resumed
snapfull resumed
type /quit
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
gwlog
